## 7. AUTOMATED E2E & DIAGNOSTIC TEST SUITE

Execute the full 96-test automated verification suite:

```bash
# Run Master Doctor System Diagnostic & Auto-Healer (8 Tiers)
bash scripts/master-doctor.sh

# Run Master Doctor with Automatic Issue Remediation
sudo bash scripts/master-doctor.sh --fix

# Run E2E Integration Suite (73 Tests)
python3 tests/run_tests.py

# Run Adversarial Boundary Suite (23 Tests)
python3 -m unittest tests/test_adversarial.py
```

